OL,3,GNEWSAArtificial tongue helps doctor
OL,4,Aspeak clearly
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor who lost most of her tongue
OL,7,Fduring cancer treatment has been fitted
OL,8,Fwith what is believed to be the first
OL,9,Fprosthetic of its kind to be made on
OL,10,Fthe NHS.
OL,12,FImogen Brooks, from Newham, east
OL,13,FLondon, had most of her tongue removed
OL,14,Fand reconstructed when she was 26 after
OL,15,Fbeing diagnosed with head and neck
OL,16,Fcancer. Radiotherapy shrank the
OL,17,Fremaining tissue, which affected her
OL,18,Fspeech.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
