OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAArtificial tongue helps doctor
OL,4,Aspeak clearly
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter researching prosthetic tongues,
OL,7,FBrooks asked clinicians at Guy's and St
OL,8,FThomas' NHS Foundation Trust whether
OL,9,Fshe could be a candidate.
OL,11,FMichael Brown, a dental technician at
OL,12,Fthe hospital, said: "We'd never made
OL,13,Fsomething like this before, but our
OL,14,Fteam loves a challenge."
